{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">美伊談判陷入停滯，原油期貨價格跌約百分之1。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">紐約期油收市報90.42美元一桶，升1.04美元，升幅百分之1.1。倫敦期油收市報103.53美元一桶，升94美仙，升幅百分之0.9。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T23:20:15.724603+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}